5... h6 6. Nxf7 Kxf7 7. Ne5+ Ke6?? { The worst place to put your king, } 8. d4! { This move is the only move that keeps a giant advantage for white. } 8... Nbd7 (8... b5 { Stopping Bc4 } 9. Be2 { But now white goes for Bg5! } 9... Qe8 10. O-O Nbd7 11. Re1) 9. Bc4+! Nd5 10. Bxd5+ cxd5 11. Qg4+! Kd6 (11... Kf6 12. Qg6#) 12. Nf7+ { And black can resign. } *


