7. Nf3 Nbd7 8. Bd3! { Aiming for the weak light squares. } 8... e6 9. O-O Bd6 10. Re1 { Bringing the rook into the position! } 10... Re8 11. Ne5+ { Centralizing the knight... } 11... Bxe5?? { Not a good move for black. } (11... Kg8 12. Qf3 c5 13. c3 Nb6) 12. dxe5 Nd5 13. Qh5+! { A great move! Pressuring the king with check and forcing a push back which causes more tacticial brilliants! } 13... Kg8 14. Bxh6!! { Dont boo, Spam the brilliant emote!! We will see what happen if black takes here. } 14... gxh6 (14... Nf8 { What if black doesnt accept the sacrifice? Here black doesnt defend the very important g7 pawn, which allows... } 15. Bxg7!! { Completely brutalizing black. } 15... Kxg7 16. Re4 { And black can resign in this position due to all of the mates threatened here! }) 15. Qg6+ Kh8 (15... Kf8 16. Qxh6+ Kg8 17. Bh7+ Kf7 (17... Kh8 18. Bg6+ Kg8 19. Qh7+ Kf8 20. Qf7#) 18. Bg6+ Kg8 19. Qh7+ Kf8 20. Qf7#) 16. Qh7# *


