[Annotator "https://lichess.org/@/captainamogus"]
[UTCDate "2024.01.31"]
[UTCTime "11:09:07"]

{ The Alien Gambit and the Caro-Kane are both interesting gambits that involve an f7 square being exploited. However, the Alien Gambit is a bit more positional, as we can see through moves like O-O-, Re1. In the Caro-Kane, we are trying open up the F File for our rook through f4. However in the Alien Gambit, we bring our Re1 and play for rook lifts in the future. }
 *


